# VATM WebFTS - VVTS surface taxi to RWY 25L departure scenario
# Generated from EHAM-TAXI.SCN command style + VVTS ground movement/parking coordinate PDFs
# Decision-support / Non-operational
# Scope: aircraft start at assigned TSN stands, taxi via apron/taxiway nodes to RWY 25L/S3, then take off westbound.
# Note: taxiway control nodes are approximate from chart visualization; replace with authoritative AIXM/AMDB nodes when available.

# Sim
 0:00:00.00>navdb worldnav
 0:00:00.00>NOISE OFF
 0:00:00.00>radardt 0.0
 0:00:00.00>navdt 0.0
 0:00:00.00>rtf 1.0
 0:00:00.00>SWTAXI ON
 0:00:00.00>pan vvts

# Reso / protection preview
